    "intro_narrative": "The infamous 'Cryptic Killer' has struck again, leaving behind nothing but a sealed laboratory filled with bizarre computational devices. As the lead detective on the case, you've tracked the suspect to this underground bunker, but the reinforced door has locked behind you. The killer loves to play twisted games, turning crucial physical evidence into mathematical riddles and complex digital ciphers. Somewhere hidden within this room's mainframe is the final piece of evidence needed to crack the case wide open. You must navigate through these heavy-duty calculators, decryption terminals, and scattered handwritten notes. Analyze the clues carefully, figure out how to chain the machinery together, and synthesize the ultimate proof before the trail goes cold forever.",
    "narrative_style": "detective"
